  "goodToKnow": "Die Saat is seed for sowing or the act of sowing: die Saat ausbringen, die Wintersaat. Figuratively: die Saat des Misstrauens säen (to sow the seeds of mistrust). Das Saatgut is seed stock, and der Samen is a single seed. The proverb Was der Mensch sät, das wird er ernten (you reap what you sow) is from the Bible. Säen means to sow. Plural: die Saaten."
